      ],
      "justification": "The branch, guards, and condition-check action collectively model the exclusive split triggered by this clause, with the negative arm leading to the specified faculty notification."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly implements the positive arm action specified in the source."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
